Package: readreq
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Resources and Energy Quarterly Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chartwell", "Macro", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com")
Description: Discovers, snapshots, parses, validates and compares every table
    in official Australian Resources and Energy Quarterly forecast and
    historical workbooks. Immutable content-addressed caches and explicit
    period, status, unit and provenance fields make exact vintages
    reproducible offline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readreq
BugReports: https://github.com/chartwell-macro/readreq/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
